{"seq":2,"slug":"music","title":"音乐学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/university/arts/music","introMarkdown":"# 音乐学 简介\n\n音乐学是对音乐进行系统研究的学科，涵盖从声学物理到文化意义的广阔光谱。当你聆听一首交响乐时，和声的进行为何让人感到紧张或舒展？一段旋律怎样在不同文化中被赋予截然不同的情感色彩？音乐学帮助你穿透感性体验的表面，理解音乐运作的内在机制。\n\n自学音乐学并不要求你是一位熟练的演奏者，但需要你愿意大量聆听并尝试用分析性的耳朵去听。一首巴赫赋格、一段京剧唱腔、一首摇滚经典——每种音乐都是一个微型的声音世界，等待你去拆解它的结构和探索它的历史语境。\n\n本学习空间将音乐学的核心内容组织为四个章节。**第一章 音乐理论** 建立分析音乐的基本语言，涵盖和声与对位法、音乐作品分析方法以及配器法的基本原理。**第二章 音乐史** 以历史视角梳理音乐的演变轨迹，分别追溯西方古典音乐、中国传统音乐和流行音乐的发展脉络。**第三章 音乐表演** 聚焦声音的实现过程，讨论声乐技巧、器乐演奏和合奏指挥中的核心问题。**第四章 音乐技术** 关注技术如何改变音乐的创作和传播方式，涵盖音乐制作、声音工程和计算机音乐。\n\n建议在学习理论知识的同时保持持续的音乐聆听习惯。每学一个概念，就去音乐中寻找对应的实例——这种\"听中学、学中听\"的方式能让抽象的乐理真正转化为你的听觉直觉。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"music-theory","title":"音乐理论","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/arts/music/music-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"harmony","title":"大学音乐学 — 和声学","url":"/education/university/arts/music/music-theory/harmony"},{"seq":2,"slug":"counterpoint","title":"大学音乐学 — 对位法","url":"/education/university/arts/music/music-theory/counterpoint"},{"seq":3,"slug":"music-form-analysis","title":"大学音乐学 — 曲式分析","url":"/education/university/arts/music/music-theory/music-form-analysis"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"music-history","title":"音乐史","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/arts/music/music-history","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"western-music-history","title":"大学音乐学 — 西方音乐史","url":"/education/university/arts/music/music-history/western-music-history"},{"seq":2,"slug":"chinese-music-history","title":"大学音乐学 — 中国音乐史","url":"/education/university/arts/music/music-history/chinese-music-history"},{"seq":3,"slug":"popular-music","title":"大学音乐学 — 流行音乐","url":"/education/university/arts/music/music-history/popular-music"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"music-performance","title":"音乐表演","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/arts/music/music-performance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vocal-techniques","title":"声乐技巧与演唱","url":"/education/university/arts/music/music-performance/vocal-techniques"},{"seq":2,"slug":"instrumental-performance","title":"器乐演奏基础","url":"/education/university/arts/music/music-performance/instrumental-performance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"conducting","title":"指挥艺术","url":"/education/university/arts/music/music-performance/conducting"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"music-technology","title":"音乐技术","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/arts/music/music-technology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"recording-engineering","title":"录音工程基础","url":"/education/university/arts/music/music-technology/recording-engineering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"music-production","title":"音乐制作与编曲","url":"/education/university/arts/music/music-technology/music-production"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sound-design","title":"声音设计","url":"/education/university/arts/music/music-technology/sound-design"}]}]}